         "value":"The system uses m-CAP modulation for data transmission and RSS-based positioning for sensing. The m-CAP modulation is a multi-carrier scheme that divides the frequency spectrum into multiple sub-bands, each modulated with CAP through the use of digital or analog pulse shaping filters. The RSS-based positioning technique uses the received signal strength to estimate the distance between the user equipment (UE) and the access points (APs). The system assumes a line-of-sight (LOS) component of the received optical signal for estimating the distances between the UE and the APs."
